{"scene_id": "s02020", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02020.fountain", "heading": "INT. STALLED CABLE CAR - GORGE CROSSING - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "IMANI OKORO", "names": ["IMANI OKORO", "IMANI"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 18}, {"id": 1, "name": "PETR HALAS", "names": ["PETR HALAS", "PETR"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 19}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. STALLED CABLE CAR - GORGE CROSSING - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A steel box the size of a closet, hanging from one cable over a drop of four hundred meters.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Wind pushes at the glass.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "The motor has been dead for six hours.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "IMANI OKORO (30s, park ranger, sunburnt neck, frayed jacket) sits on the floor with her back against the door.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "PETR HALAS (60s, retired surveyor, wool cap, thermos) stands, one hand on the rail.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "The car sways.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "They both freeze.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "It settles.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "They both breathe out.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thermos. How much is left?", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Half a cup. Maybe less.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We split it at dusk.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We split it now. Dusk is a rumor.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Petr.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fine. Dusk.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Imani pulls the radio from her belt, thumbs the switch.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Static.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "She tries again.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Static.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "She throws it onto the bench, then fetches it back.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Batteries are fine. Battery's fine. It's the gorge.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to herself"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Say again?", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nothing. The walls eat the signal.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we stop wasting the battery on it.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We have the battery for exactly this.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We have the battery for three more tries. I counted your tries.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You counted.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I measured land for forty years. I count things.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then count this. Rescue knows the line stopped at nine this morning. They know there are two cars on the north span. They send a crew when the wind drops under forty.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And when does the wind drop under forty?", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tonight. Tomorrow at the latest.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said that at noon.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "At noon it was true.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "At noon you also said the cable would hold the whole day, no problem.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The cable is rated for six times our weight.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Rated by whom?", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "By people who do not want to be in here with you.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That is almost funny.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am almost laughing.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My knees are going. I would like to sit.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then sit. There is room.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There is room if you move your boots.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My boots are not the problem.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your boots are the whole problem.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Imani draws her legs in.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Petr lowers himself onto the bench opposite and winces.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "The car rocks.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "They grab for each other's sleeves, then pull back, embarrassed.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Forty years on solid ground.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["muttering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Imani unzips her jacket and spreads it over his knees without a word.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am not cold.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "The wind drops a notch.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Far below, a river keeps talking to itself.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hear that? Wind's easing.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Or I am going deaf.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Either way, we are closer to morning.", "name": "IMANI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Pour the coffee, ranger.", "name": "PETR", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "She does.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Half a cup, divided with great care.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}